@JsonDeserialize on Map with contentUsing custom deserializer overwrites default behavior


<p dir="auto">I recently updated from version 2.3.3 to 2.5.1 and encountered a new issue with our custom deserializers. They either seemed to stop working or were active on the wrong fields.<br/>
I could narrow it down to some change in version 2.4.4 (2.4.3 is still working for me)</p>
<p dir="auto">I wrote a test to show this behavior. It seems to appear when there a two maps with the same key and value types in a bean, and only one of them has a custom deserializer. The deserializer is then falsely used either for both or none of the maps.</p>
<p dir="auto">This test works for me in version 2.4.3 and fails with higher versions.</p>
